 | Option | Meaning |
 | --- | --- |
-| `--since DATE` | Only rows changed on or after DATE (YYYY-MM-DD). |
+| `--after DATE` | Only rows changed on or after DATE (YYYY-MM-DD). |
 | `--output FILE` | Write to FILE instead of stdout. |
 
-Without `--since`, every row is written.
-`--since` shares its name and meaning with the API's filter, so a date copied from an API query selects the same rows.
+Without `--after`, every row is written.
+`--after` has the same meaning as the API's `since` filter (the option and the filter are named differently), so a date copied from an API query selects the same rows.
